1
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:04,120
Earth.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:09,639
- Let go.
- No, I won't.

3
00:00:09,639 --> 00:00:12,070
- Let go.
- I like you, Earth.

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,589
You said you like me.

5
00:00:15,559 --> 00:00:23,530
Isn't it a bit too late? When I asked you…
when I wanted to hear it… you never said it.

6
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:30,807
But now that I'm walking out of your life,
you come back and confuse me again… why? I'm done.

7
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:37,975
- I won't go back and let you hurt me again.
- Earth…

8
00:00:40,016 --> 00:00:45,120
- Enough, Gun.
- Earth, but… but…

9
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:53,143
Gun, you should just go back first.
Right now, Earth isn't ready to talk to you.

10
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:58,917
Doesn't matter what day it is—
my answer won't change.

11
00:01:01,149 --> 00:01:04,741
Do you know how much courage
I had to gather…

12
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:08,375
just to admit my own feelings?

13
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:16,280
I know, damn it…
I know I'm too late, Earth.

14
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:24,240
But can you give me some time to prove it?
Whatever hurt you—

15
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:30,840
I won't do it again.
Whatever you don't like—I'll stop.

16
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:37,280
I just…
I'm just asking for a chance, Earth.

17
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:42,680
How are you going to prove it?

18
00:01:44,119 --> 00:01:52,240
Just go back, Gun. You don't have to like me.
Just let me go. That's enough.
